            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "1010lisalynn"
            },
            "reviewBody": "An Adult Root Beer Float! A tasty drink worthy of channeling your inner childhood flavors. This is the first time in years I’ve had root beer. The memory of the taste took no time at all to come back. This cocktail recipe is quick and easy to make, no fancy mixology is needed. I used Salted Caramel Kahlua; otherwise I used the ingredients as listed in the recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2024-05-24T05:53:58.047Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
