              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "celineebeenie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Really smooth.\nFollowed the recipe to a T.\nUsed Crown Royale Dark. \nTripled the recipe and put the drinks in mason jars.\nOh yah!!!",
            "datePublished": "2020-06-07T10:09:17.233Z"
          },
          {
