            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Buy a good quality root beer (mine was A&amp;W) because that’s the dominant flavor. I thought I slowly poured in the milk, but it still curdled which was a bit off-putting for a cocktail. It is smooth, and the ingredients are certainly complementary, but this one’s just a bit too fancyschmancy for me.",
            "datePublished": "2024-05-31T10:25:22.586Z"
